-/* Latest-post strip. Sits between the gradient stat band and the white "Why"
-   section, so it takes a light indigo tint to read as a continuation of the
-   band rather than as a new section. */
-.lf-newsbar {
-  background: #EEF2FF;
-  border-bottom: 1px solid #E0E7FF;
